  "question": {
    "text": "In the following skew conformation of ethane, <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8243;</mo></mrow></msup></math> dihedral angle is:<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0291_892563373e77.png\" />"
